# Docker build context ignores .gitignore, so the guards there do not apply
# here. `COPY server ./server` would otherwise bake a local server/.env — and
# any service-account key dropped in by accident — into the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*service-account*.json
**/*-sa.json
**/saydle-api*.json
**/node_modules
**/build
.git
.github
.expo
ios
android
__tests__
server/tests
coverage
*.md
!server/README.md
